ry":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids in Lamb County, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 45 of the 75 years since 1951. In 2025 the middle ran 166% of normal in April to May and 37% in November to December. So far in 2026 it sat at 9% of normal in February to March. Every grid but 17211 had its driest year in 2011.</p>"}
